    "buildCommand": "node \"/Users/nyimbiodero/.claude/plugins/cache/openai-codex/codex/1.0.5/scripts/codex-companion.mjs\" task \"Working directory: /Users/nyimbiodero/src/pjs/dArchiva/darchiva-ui\n\nReplace all raw browser confirm() / window.confirm() dialogs with proper shadcn/ui AlertDialog components.\n\n## Files to fix (13 occurrences):\n1. src/features/ingestion/components/IngestionTemplates.tsx — 'Delete this template?'\n2. src/features/automation/AutomationRulesPage.tsx — 'Delete this automation rule?'\n3. src/features/scanner/components/ScanProfilesManager.tsx — 'Delete this profile?'\n4. src/features/comments/CommentsPanel.tsx — 'Delete this comment?'\n5. src/features/security/components/PolicyList.tsx — 'Are you sure you want to delete this policy?'\n6. src/features/security/components/DepartmentAccessMatrix.tsx — 'Revoke this department access?'\n7. src/features/scanning-projects/components/BatchTemplateManager.tsx — 'Delete this template?'\n8. src/features/scanning-projects/components/VirtualRebundler.tsx — merge and split confirms\n9. src/features/scanning-projects/components/ProjectMembersTab.tsx — remove member confirm\n10. src/features/agents/components/FleetManagement.tsx — 'Retire agent? Cannot be undone.'\n11. src/features/email-ingest/EmailIngestConfigs.tsx — 'Delete config? Cannot be undone.'\n12. src/features/tenants/components/TenantUsersList.tsx — remove user from tenant confirm\n13. src/features/reports/ScheduledReportsPage.tsx — 'Delete scheduled report?'\n\n## Pattern to use in each file:\n\nAdd state at the top of the relevant component:\n\\`\\`\\`tsx\nconst [confirmDialog, setConfirmDialog] = useState<{ message: string; onConfirm: () => void } | null>(null);\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nReplace:\n\\`\\`\\`tsx\nif (confirm('Delete this X?')) {\n  doDelete(id);\n}\n\\`\\`\\`\nWith:\n\\`\\`\\`tsx\nsetConfirmDialog({ message: 'Delete this X?', onConfirm: () => doDelete(id) });\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nAdd this AlertDialog at the bottom of the component's JSX (before the final closing tag):\n\\`\\`\\`tsx\n<AlertDialog open={!!confirmDialog} onOpenChange={() => setConfirmDialog(null)}>\n  <AlertDialogContent>\n    <AlertDialogHeader>\n      <AlertDialogTitle>Confirm</AlertDialogTitle>\n      <AlertDialogDescription>{confirmDialog?.message}</AlertDialogDescription>\n    </AlertDialogHeader>\n    <AlertDialogFooter>\n      <AlertDialogCancel>Cancel</AlertDialogCancel>\n      <AlertDialogAction\n        onClick={() => { confirmDialog?.onConfirm(); setConfirmDialog(null); }}\n        className=\\\"bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700\\\"\n      >\n        Confirm\n      </AlertDialogAction>\n    </AlertDialogFooter>\n  </AlertDialogContent>\n</AlertDialog>\n\\`\\`\\`\n\nImport AlertDialog components from '@/components/ui/alert-dialog':\n\\`\\`\\`tsx\nimport {\n  AlertDialog,\n  AlertDialogAction,\n  AlertDialogCancel,\n  AlertDialogContent,\n  AlertDialogDescription,\n  AlertDialogFooter,\n  AlertDialogHeader,\n  AlertDialogTitle,\n} from '@/components/ui/alert-dialog';\n\\`\\`\\`\n\n## Important notes:\n- useState is always available (already imported in these files, or add it to the import)\n- The alert-dialog component IS available in shadcn — do not create it\n- For components that already return a fragment or div, just append the AlertDialog before the last closing tag\n- For VirtualRebundler.tsx which has two confirms, use the same single confirmDialog state for both\n- Make sure you read each file carefully before editing to understand its structure\n\nAfter all edits:\nnpx tsc --noEmit --skipLibCheck\nFix any TypeScript errors.\nThen: git add -A && git commit -m 'fix: replace all confirm() dialogs with shadcn AlertDialog'\nThen: git push\" --write",
